{"seq":3,"slug":"visionary-legacy","title":"远见的遗产","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inspiring-a-generation","title":"激励一代人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy/inspiring-a-generation","wordCount":1370,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-multiplanetary-dream","title":"多行星梦想","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/elon-musk/influence-and-legacy/visionary-legacy/the-multiplanetary-dream","wordCount":1503,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"远见的遗产\">远见的遗产</h1><p>马斯克最无形、也最深远的遗产，在于他对人类精神与想象的影响。本章揭示这份远见的遗产。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述&quot;激励一代人&quot;——他如何重燃人们对硬科技与宏大梦想的热情。第二篇文档讲述&quot;多行星梦想&quot;,呈现他让人类成为多行星物种的宏愿，如何改变了人类对自身未来的想象。</p>\n"}